<title>USA: New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Nov 18.</title>
<headline>New York coal/ore/scrap fixtures - Nov 18.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - TBN (3 cargoes) 140,000 long tons each Aug '97/Mar '98 Porto Bolivar/Stignaes &amp; Asnaes $5.95 S.K. Power.</p>
<p>IRON ORE - TBN 150,000 long tons iron ore 10-20/12 Port Hadland/Fos $8.15 fio seven days cnr.</p>
<p>-- New York Commodity Desk, +1 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
